        },
        {
          "id": "player_happy_short_001_02",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "嬉しいことは、ちゃんと机の上に置いて見えるようにしよ。なくならないように。",
          "displayText": "Let us place happy things on the desk where we can see them, so they do not disappear too quickly.",
